# Temporary / Logs
# NOTE: `*.txt` is deliberately blunt, and it bites. `requirements.txt` only
# survives because it was tracked before this rule existed — gitignore does not
# affect files already in the index. Any NEW .txt that the app actually needs
# must be un-ignored below, or it is silently absent from the deploy and the
# failure only shows up in production.
*.txt
!requirements.txt
!workshop/templates/workshop/robots.txt
TITAN_BLUEPRINT.html
errors.log

# Local tech-debt backlog (consolidated from the old audit files, kept off git by choice)
TECH_DEBT.md

# Database dumps / one-off exports (may contain password hashes & session keys)
sqlite_data_dump.json
*_dump.json

# Local editing workspace
Aditing files/

# Claude Code local workspace: session settings, launch config, and git
# worktrees created for background tasks. Machine-specific, never shared.
.claude/

# Repomix output
repomix-output.*
repomix.config.json
